1
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:12,000
"Echo Of A Letter"
(Episode 12)

2
00:00:17,440 --> 00:00:18,119
Hello, sir.

3
00:00:18,199 --> 00:00:19,599
Hi, I'm Chen Wan.

4
00:00:19,679 --> 00:00:19,920
Hello.

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:20,920
I'd like to see Ms. Ge.

6
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:22,400
Is she available?

7
00:00:22,480 --> 00:00:23,759
Please have a seat over there.

8
00:00:23,839 --> 00:00:25,239
I'll call upstairs to let her know.

9
00:00:25,760 --> 00:00:26,760
Okay.

10
00:00:49,079 --> 00:00:50,160
I'm really sorry.

11
00:00:50,240 --> 00:00:51,600
Ms. Ge is tied up right now.

12
00:00:52,880 --> 00:00:53,880
That's fine.

13
00:00:53,920 --> 00:00:55,360
I didn't have an appointment anyway.

14
00:00:56,320 --> 00:00:57,200
Sir.

15
00:00:57,280 --> 00:00:59,719
Ms. Ge might be booked
for the rest of the day.

16
00:00:59,799 --> 00:01:01,159
It's fine. I'll wait a bit longer.

17
00:01:01,759 --> 00:01:03,359
Please have a seat here for a moment.

18
00:01:10,760 --> 00:01:11,519
Hello, sir.

19
00:01:11,599 --> 00:01:12,639
Right this way, please.

20
00:01:12,719 --> 00:01:13,719
Thank you.

21
00:01:15,200 --> 00:01:16,200
This way.

22
00:01:18,200 --> 00:01:19,200
Ms. Ge.

23
00:01:20,879 --> 00:01:21,719
What is so important

24
00:01:21,799 --> 00:01:23,480
that kept Mr. Chen waiting for so long?

25
00:01:24,359 --> 00:01:25,760
I have a few photos here.

26
00:01:25,840 --> 00:01:27,439
I wonder if you've seen them, Ms. Ge.

27
00:01:42,280 --> 00:01:44,359
Well, aren't you interesting?

28
00:01:44,439 --> 00:01:47,359
Your mother is having
an affair with my husband,

29
00:01:47,439 --> 00:01:49,879
and you personally bring me the photos?

30
00:01:49,959 --> 00:01:51,519
I came all this way,

31
00:01:51,599 --> 00:01:53,400
obviously not just to
break the news to you.

32
00:01:54,879 --> 00:01:56,279
What's your endgame?

33
00:01:56,359 --> 00:01:57,359
I'm here

34
00:01:57,400 --> 00:01:58,320
to talk to you

35
00:01:58,400 --> 00:02:00,000
about acquiring shares in Rongxin.

36
00:02:02,120 --> 00:02:03,680
What are you talking about, Mr. Chen?

37
00:02:03,760 --> 00:02:04,879
I'm afraid I don't follow.

38
00:02:09,319 --> 00:02:11,479
This gem is a pigeon's blood ruby.

39
00:02:13,199 --> 00:02:14,119
Its original collector

40
00:02:14,199 --> 00:02:15,359
was a Swedish woman

41
00:02:15,439 --> 00:02:16,959
named Carmel.

42
00:02:17,039 --> 00:02:17,880
And she

43
00:02:17,960 --> 00:02:20,360
used to be a tutor for the Ge family.

44
00:02:21,960 --> 00:02:23,559
Yet this ruby

45
00:02:23,639 --> 00:02:25,839
is now in your mother's possession.

46
00:02:25,919 --> 00:02:28,000
A pigeon's blood ruby like this

47
00:02:28,080 --> 00:02:30,480
is worth a plot of land in Central.

48
00:02:30,560 --> 00:02:32,479
Moving that kind of capital

49
00:02:33,080 --> 00:02:34,600
isn't something Mr. Meng

50
00:02:34,680 --> 00:02:36,280
could pull off on his own.

51
00:02:37,960 --> 00:02:40,800
Song Qingmiao doesn't have much of a brain,

52
00:02:41,479 --> 00:02:43,320
but her son

53
00:02:43,400 --> 00:02:45,040
is both smart and devoted.

54
00:02:45,120 --> 00:02:47,399
So, by way of apology,

55
00:02:47,479 --> 00:02:49,399
I'm willing to do my small part.

56
00:02:49,479 --> 00:02:50,639
All I ask is that you

57
00:02:50,719 --> 00:02:53,239
release a press statement
under Taiji's name,

58
00:02:53,319 --> 00:02:54,320
saying that

59
00:02:54,400 --> 00:02:56,880
you invited my mother, Song Qingmiao,

60
00:02:56,960 --> 00:02:59,119
to visit the Taiji flagship store,

61
00:02:59,199 --> 00:03:00,439
and Mr. Meng accompanied you.

62
00:03:02,120 --> 00:03:03,160
That's it?

63
00:03:03,240 --> 00:03:04,440
That's it.

64
00:03:04,520 --> 00:03:07,600
My husband is a major
shareholder in Rongxin,

65
00:03:07,680 --> 00:03:09,079
while you

66
00:03:09,159 --> 00:03:12,239
aren't even in their inner circle.

67
00:03:12,319 --> 00:03:13,720
Why should I trust you?

68
00:03:13,800 --> 00:03:15,560
Because I'm more useful
than Meng Yuanxiong.

69
00:03:16,599 --> 00:03:18,776
I'm willing to transfer two
percent of Rongxin's shares

70
00:03:18,800 --> 00:03:19,800
to your name upfront.

71
00:03:20,840 --> 00:03:22,720
Then you can take your time deciding

72
00:03:22,799 --> 00:03:24,518
whether you want to partner with me.

73
00:03:24,599 --> 00:03:25,599
There's no rush.

74
00:03:27,159 --> 00:03:28,159
Ms. Ge.

75
00:03:29,280 --> 00:03:30,759
Please enjoy, Mr. Chen.

76
00:03:33,319 --> 00:03:34,519
Coming here today,

77
00:03:34,599 --> 00:03:36,679
you're not just trying to
save your mother, are you?

78
00:03:37,199 --> 00:03:38,920
You want to

79
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:40,440
get me to do your dirty work

80
00:03:40,520 --> 00:03:41,880
and kill two birds with one stone.

81
00:03:42,400 --> 00:03:44,399
Rongxin has been operating for years,

82
00:03:44,479 --> 00:03:46,400
and it's rotting from the inside.

83
00:03:47,039 --> 00:03:49,960
It desperately needs a major overhaul.

84
00:03:51,080 --> 00:03:54,600
I'm just an honest businesswoman.

85
00:03:54,680 --> 00:03:56,919
I have no interest in breaking the law.

86
00:03:59,120 --> 00:04:00,719
I don't do anything illegal either.

87
00:04:06,479 --> 00:04:08,000
I'll give you one week.

88
00:04:08,719 --> 00:04:09,879
Show me

89
00:04:11,319 --> 00:04:14,079
if you have what it takes to pull this off.

90
00:04:14,159 --> 00:04:15,159
Deal.

91
00:04:16,079 --> 00:04:17,799
Some people get too greedy.

92
00:04:17,879 --> 00:04:20,160
Sooner or later, they'll pay the price.

93
00:04:25,480 --> 00:04:26,840
I heard the Lai Chi Wun Pier

94
00:04:26,920 --> 00:04:28,295
and the offshore oil channel projects

95
00:04:28,319 --> 00:04:30,240
are slated to go public
at the end of the year.

96
00:04:31,720 --> 00:04:32,720
Wan,

97
00:04:32,800 --> 00:04:34,480
you'll be on the roadshow team too, right?

98
00:04:34,560 --> 00:04:35,560
Liao Quan,

99
00:04:36,439 --> 00:04:38,279
what do you actually want from me?

100
00:04:38,879 --> 00:04:40,560
Looking to lose another finger?

101
00:04:41,839 --> 00:04:43,679
Your temper hasn't changed a bit.

102
00:04:43,759 --> 00:04:45,239
Just like when we were kids.

103
00:04:45,319 --> 00:04:46,520
Cut me some slack.

104
00:04:46,600 --> 00:04:47,400
There are some things

105
00:04:47,480 --> 00:04:48,920
we need to hash out, right?

106
00:04:50,319 --> 00:04:52,439
Wiping out anyone who gets in my way—

107
00:04:52,519 --> 00:04:53,879
that part of me hasn't changed.

108
00:04:56,160 --> 00:04:57,375
When you lost your mind as a kid,

109
00:04:57,399 --> 00:04:59,799
locking you up in Xiaolanshan
for a few years did the trick.

110
00:05:00,319 --> 00:05:02,360
Still losing your mind
now that you're grown?

111
00:05:07,800 --> 00:05:08,800
Wan,

112
00:05:09,759 --> 00:05:11,400
do you look at Zhao Shengge

113
00:05:11,480 --> 00:05:13,040
with those same eyes?

114
00:05:14,639 --> 00:05:16,119
How many times did he sleep with you?

115
00:05:17,360 --> 00:05:20,040
How many times did it
take to land this project?

116
00:05:23,120 --> 00:05:24,720
In that regard,

117
00:05:24,800 --> 00:05:27,199
you're even better than your mother.

118
00:05:28,079 --> 00:05:29,559
Keep running that filthy mouth,

119
00:05:29,639 --> 00:05:31,959
and I have ten thousand
ways to make you disappear.

120
00:05:32,720 --> 00:05:33,640
Isn't that the truth?

121
00:05:33,720 --> 00:05:34,759
You're so precious.

122
00:05:36,199 --> 00:05:37,359
Off-limits to everyone else,

123
00:05:37,439 --> 00:05:38,759
only he gets a turn.

124
00:05:38,839 --> 00:05:40,359
Tell me, does Zhao Shengge know

125
00:05:40,439 --> 00:05:41,815
you were locked up in a shameful place

126
00:05:41,839 --> 00:05:43,680
like Xiaolanshan?

127
00:05:44,319 --> 00:05:45,520
I'm just saying, what if

128
00:05:45,600 --> 00:05:48,319
your mother's scandal
and the public backlash

129
00:05:49,240 --> 00:05:51,199
derail the IPO and roadshow

130
00:05:51,279 --> 00:05:53,999
for the Lai Chi Wun Pier
and offshore oil projects?

131
00:05:54,079 --> 00:05:55,400
Tell me,

132
00:05:55,480 --> 00:05:57,079
will Zhao Shengge still want you?

133
00:05:57,839 --> 00:05:59,319
And how will he

134
00:05:59,399 --> 00:06:00,800
explain it to his shareholders?

135
00:06:04,160 --> 00:06:05,600
Meng Yuanxiong even gave your mother

136
00:06:05,639 --> 00:06:07,679
a vintage pigeon's blood ruby.

137
00:06:07,759 --> 00:06:09,239
Where did he get that kind of money?

138
00:06:09,319 --> 00:06:10,999
If his wife Ge Xi starts digging into it,

139
00:06:11,079 --> 00:06:12,336
how will you convince the authorities

140
00:06:12,360 --> 00:06:13,239
and investors

141
00:06:13,319 --> 00:06:15,120
that your financial statements are clean?

142
00:06:15,920 --> 00:06:17,520
Just with these?

143
00:06:17,600 --> 00:06:18,920
This is more than enough.

144
00:06:19,639 --> 00:06:21,400
As long as it sparks a public outcry.

145
00:06:21,480 --> 00:06:22,559
Given your mother's fame,

146
00:06:22,639 --> 00:06:24,879
you know that once these photos leak,

147
00:06:24,959 --> 00:06:26,280
your dad will deal with her.

148
00:06:26,360 --> 00:06:27,360
And Meng Yuanxiong's wife

149
00:06:27,439 --> 00:06:29,079
is the eldest daughter of Taiji Group.

150
00:06:29,720 --> 00:06:30,640
You know better than I do

151
00:06:30,720 --> 00:06:32,800
how ruthless Ge Xi can be.

152
00:06:33,600 --> 00:06:35,216
When that happens, Zhao Shengge's project

153
00:06:35,240 --> 00:06:38,120
will be completely
discredited by a sex scandal.

154
00:06:39,240 --> 00:06:40,439
Three birds with one stone.

155
00:06:41,040 --> 00:06:42,400
This is plenty.

156
00:06:42,480 --> 00:06:44,080
Is this your idea,

157
00:06:44,160 --> 00:06:45,160
or the Chen family's?

158
00:06:49,720 --> 00:06:50,720
That's right.

159
00:06:51,759 --> 00:06:52,840
Your dad

160
00:06:52,920 --> 00:06:53,759
wanted to come to you too,

161
00:06:53,839 --> 00:06:55,840
but I beat him to the punch.

162
00:06:55,920 --> 00:06:57,439
Because I have just a little bit more

163
00:06:57,519 --> 00:06:59,000
leverage than he does.

164
00:07:00,480 --> 00:07:01,799
What do you want?

165
00:07:01,879 --> 00:07:03,600
I want the building materials contract.

166
00:07:03,680 --> 00:07:05,840
Minglong is the biggest ship in Haishi.

167
00:07:05,920 --> 00:07:06,799
No matter what,

168
00:07:06,879 --> 00:07:08,495
I should get a piece of
the pie, don't you think?

169
00:07:08,519 --> 00:07:09,560
In your dreams.

170
00:07:10,480 --> 00:07:10,960
Wan,

171
00:07:11,040 --> 00:07:12,519
stop playing dumb with me.

172
00:07:13,160 --> 00:07:14,960
To get us the transit shipping contract,

173
00:07:15,040 --> 00:07:17,199
you definitely have that much pull.

174
00:07:18,319 --> 00:07:20,639
Or is your pillow talk not working?

175
00:07:23,560 --> 00:07:24,680
This tea is pretty good.

176
00:07:27,560 --> 00:07:29,280
You know very well

177
00:07:29,360 --> 00:07:30,199
what kind of shape Rongxin is in right now.

178
00:07:30,279 --> 00:07:31,679
If I didn't come to you today,

179
00:07:31,759 --> 00:07:34,280
your dad would have.

180
00:07:34,360 --> 00:07:36,319
And he wouldn't give you a damn thing.

181
00:07:36,399 --> 00:07:37,879
You're better off working with me,

182
00:07:37,959 --> 00:07:38,879
don't you think?

183
00:07:38,959 --> 00:07:39,999
Work with you?

184
00:07:40,079 --> 00:07:41,239
What's in it for me?

185
00:07:41,319 --> 00:07:42,199
I guarantee that

186
00:07:42,279 --> 00:07:43,359
once I win the bid,

187
00:07:43,439 --> 00:07:45,160
the photos will be destroyed immediately.

188
00:07:45,720 --> 00:07:46,960
No backups.

189
00:07:47,040 --> 00:07:49,160
Besides, if you want to bury this for good,

190
00:07:49,240 --> 00:07:51,560
you'd best get me on
board Zhao Shengge's ship.

191
00:07:52,120 --> 00:07:54,080
Then our interests will be aligned.

192
00:07:54,160 --> 00:07:56,240
We sink or swim together.

193
00:07:57,759 --> 00:08:00,040
I wouldn't shoot myself
in the foot, would I?

194
00:08:00,639 --> 00:08:01,999
What you have here

195
00:08:02,079 --> 00:08:03,519
isn't worth that price.

196
00:08:04,240 --> 00:08:04,960
On top of that,

197
00:08:05,040 --> 00:08:07,160
I want six percent of
Rongxin's retail shares.

198
00:08:07,240 --> 00:08:08,279
No options.

199
00:08:09,399 --> 00:08:10,759
Six percent?

200
00:08:10,839 --> 00:08:12,160
What do you want shares for?

201
00:08:12,240 --> 00:08:14,960
Expecting me to do a job for nothing?

202
00:08:15,040 --> 00:08:16,439
Keep dreaming.

203
00:08:17,199 --> 00:08:18,480
The photos and the shares—

204
00:08:18,560 --> 00:08:19,879
I want them all.

205
00:08:19,959 --> 00:08:21,239
Otherwise, no deal.

206
00:08:21,319 --> 00:08:22,480
Liao Quan,

207
00:08:22,560 --> 00:08:24,600
take a good look at how
much you're actually worth.

208
00:08:24,959 --> 00:08:27,199
Do you really think after releasing these,

209
00:08:27,279 --> 00:08:29,000
you'll walk away unscathed?

210
00:08:29,680 --> 00:08:31,359
If you mess with Zhao Shengge's project,

211
00:08:31,439 --> 00:08:32,439
he can crush you

212
00:08:32,519 --> 00:08:33,960
with a flick of his finger.

213
00:08:34,879 --> 00:08:36,079
I don't have that many shares.

214
00:08:36,440 --> 00:08:38,015
And I can't buy up that
many retail shares either.

215
00:08:38,039 --> 00:08:39,439
Then we have nothing to talk about.

216
00:08:40,559 --> 00:08:41,559
Four percent.

217
00:08:41,639 --> 00:08:42,639
Five percent.

218
00:08:44,159 --> 00:08:45,599
We'll talk once you actually get it.

219
00:08:46,639 --> 00:08:47,639
Let's not haggle over

220
00:08:47,679 --> 00:08:49,679
a measly one percent, shall we?

221
00:08:49,759 --> 00:08:50,599
Consider these funds

222
00:08:50,679 --> 00:08:53,200
seed money to reboot
the Xiaolanshan project.

223
00:08:55,639 --> 00:08:56,639
Liao Quan.

224
00:08:57,159 --> 00:08:58,440
Try any more tricks,

225
00:08:59,279 --> 00:09:00,839
and a bullet from this gun

226
00:09:00,919 --> 00:09:03,079
will go right through your skull,

227
00:09:03,159 --> 00:09:04,919
just like those scissors
nineteen years ago.

228
00:09:05,799 --> 00:09:07,319
I know, I know!

229
00:09:07,399 --> 00:09:08,839
The shares are negotiable.

230
00:09:08,919 --> 00:09:10,000
Everything's negotiable!

231
00:09:26,519 --> 00:09:27,519
Jin.

232
00:09:28,360 --> 00:09:29,120
Spill it.

233
00:09:29,200 --> 00:09:30,520
Who are we taking down this time?

234
00:09:31,519 --> 00:09:32,919
I'm pulling out of the partnership.

235
00:09:34,840 --> 00:09:35,840
Pulling out?

236
00:09:36,919 --> 00:09:38,120
It's no big deal.

237
00:09:39,120 --> 00:09:41,599
I'll still oversee the R&amp;D,

238
00:09:41,679 --> 00:09:43,079
just keep my name off

239
00:09:43,159 --> 00:09:44,679
the patents and proposals from now on.

240
00:09:46,120 --> 00:09:47,120
A clean break

241
00:09:48,120 --> 00:09:49,120
is for the best.

242
00:09:51,159 --> 00:09:53,399
Zhao Shengge practically runs Haishi.

243
00:09:54,360 --> 00:09:56,040
Dealing with these people is a piece of...

244
00:09:56,080 --> 00:09:57,240
Jin.

245
00:09:57,320 --> 00:09:58,640
These two projects

246
00:09:58,720 --> 00:10:00,176
involve top-level government directives,

247
00:10:00,200 --> 00:10:01,679
state assets, and public welfare.

248
00:10:01,759 --> 00:10:02,679
I know.

249
00:10:02,759 --> 00:10:03,760
Money is the least of it.

250
00:10:03,840 --> 00:10:05,800
Public trust and corporate
image are what matter.

251
00:10:06,919 --> 00:10:08,639
Besides, this isn't a one-time thing.

252
00:10:10,639 --> 00:10:12,439
This whole mess started because of me,

253
00:10:12,519 --> 00:10:14,320
so I should be the one to end it.

254
00:10:16,039 --> 00:10:18,160
With so much going
on, it's better to be safe.

255
00:10:18,240 --> 00:10:20,400
I don't want anything else going wrong.

256
00:10:20,480 --> 00:10:23,880
You built Kexiang from the
ground up, brick by brick.

257
00:10:23,960 --> 00:10:25,679
You know better than anyone

258
00:10:25,759 --> 00:10:27,015
how much blood and
sweat you've poured into it.

259
00:10:27,039 --> 00:10:28,920
I'm just stepping back temporarily.

260
00:10:29,000 --> 00:10:30,640
It's not like I'm walking away for good.

261
00:10:30,720 --> 00:10:32,040
Once I've sorted all this out,

262
00:10:32,120 --> 00:10:34,280
wouldn't it be better to
come back with a clean slate?

263
00:10:36,919 --> 00:10:38,040
Alright.

264
00:10:38,120 --> 00:10:39,199
Then your spot at Kexiang

265
00:10:39,279 --> 00:10:40,799
will always be waiting for you.

266
00:10:40,879 --> 00:10:42,040
As for the dividends,

267
00:10:42,120 --> 00:10:43,655
even though we can't put them on the books,

268
00:10:43,679 --> 00:10:46,080
you'll get every single cent you're owed.

269
00:10:47,279 --> 00:10:48,479
Don't go cooking the books.

270
00:10:48,559 --> 00:10:49,679
Keep everything above board.

271
00:10:50,360 --> 00:10:51,639
Thanks, Jin.

272
00:11:02,683 --> 00:11:06,010
[Zhao Shengge retracted a message]

273
00:11:13,843 --> 00:11:15,869
[What did you send?]

274
00:11:16,276 --> 00:11:17,896
[Nothing]

275
00:11:18,689 --> 00:11:21,003
[Still at work?]

276
00:11:27,816 --> 00:11:29,572
[In a meeting? How about
I come and pick you up?]

277
00:11:29,596 --> 00:11:30,596
[No need]

278
00:11:36,283 --> 00:11:37,836
[Zhao Shengge]

279
00:11:44,550 --> 00:11:46,096
[It will run late]

280
00:11:48,136 --> 00:11:49,849
[- "OK"
- Yeah]

281
00:12:18,519 --> 00:12:19,519
Done with your meeting?

282
00:12:21,919 --> 00:12:22,919
I'll drive you home.

283
00:12:23,639 --> 00:12:24,719
Have you been waiting long?

284
00:12:26,360 --> 00:12:27,880
You look a little tired.

285
00:12:27,960 --> 00:12:28,880
Zhao Shengge,

286
00:12:28,960 --> 00:12:31,000
are you this nice to all your suitors?

287
00:12:32,519 --> 00:12:34,319
Seems like this suitor
isn't very good at it.

288
00:12:34,879 --> 00:12:36,440
Alright, you drive.

289
00:12:51,200 --> 00:12:53,640
The latest survey maps
are in the folder in the back.

290
00:12:53,720 --> 00:12:54,799
Want to take a look?

291
00:12:56,080 --> 00:12:57,080
Sure.

292
00:13:05,115 --> 00:13:06,255
[Full Moon Channel]

293
00:13:06,279 --> 00:13:08,000
The data here

294
00:13:08,080 --> 00:13:10,199
is much more precise than last time.

295
00:13:10,279 --> 00:13:10,920
Yes.

296
00:13:11,000 --> 00:13:12,720
Fang Jian took a team out to remeasure it.

297
00:13:15,240 --> 00:13:18,519
You named this the Full Moon Channel?

298
00:13:19,039 --> 00:13:20,360
Yeah.

299
00:13:20,440 --> 00:13:22,120
Didn't we agree on that?

300
00:13:31,600 --> 00:13:32,640
Why are we at my place?

301
00:13:32,720 --> 00:13:33,959
I'm taking the car.

302
00:13:34,039 --> 00:13:35,320
Go inside and get some sleep.

303
00:13:45,200 --> 00:13:46,200
What is it?

304
00:13:47,039 --> 00:13:48,039
Zhao Shengge,

305
00:13:48,840 --> 00:13:50,920
can I get a kiss today?

306
00:13:51,000 --> 00:13:52,520
No kiss yesterday,

307
00:13:52,600 --> 00:13:54,200
and none today either?

308
00:13:56,759 --> 00:13:58,000
Have you won me over yet?

309
00:14:00,360 --> 00:14:01,959
We didn't kiss yesterday

310
00:14:02,039 --> 00:14:03,759
only because you didn't show up.

311
00:14:05,639 --> 00:14:06,639
Why?

312
00:14:07,399 --> 00:14:08,439
Do you want it that badly?

313
00:14:11,799 --> 00:14:12,799
Come here.

314
00:14:27,159 --> 00:14:28,159
Chen Wan.

315
00:14:28,879 --> 00:14:30,639
Are you hiding something from me?

316
00:14:31,320 --> 00:14:32,320
I'm not.

317
00:14:33,399 --> 00:14:34,399
Chen Wan,

318
00:14:36,639 --> 00:14:38,279
your heartbeat is lying.

319
00:14:40,480 --> 00:14:41,639
Let's call it a night.

320
00:14:42,679 --> 00:14:43,679
Try harder tomorrow.

321
00:14:51,399 --> 00:14:52,399
Alright then.

322
00:14:52,960 --> 00:14:54,319
I'll head in.

323
00:14:54,399 --> 00:14:56,399
You're the one Fang
Jian is testing tomorrow.

324
00:14:57,240 --> 00:14:58,880
Whatever you're hiding from me,

325
00:14:58,960 --> 00:15:00,440
you can tell me tomorrow.

326
00:15:03,399 --> 00:15:04,519
I'll head inside then.

327
00:15:16,240 --> 00:15:17,160
Zhao Shengge,

328
00:15:17,240 --> 00:15:18,240
goodbye.

329
00:16:07,000 --> 00:16:08,000
Wan.

330
00:16:08,639 --> 00:16:09,639
Hey, Xuan.

331
00:16:11,279 --> 00:16:12,720
I need a favor.

332
00:16:14,159 --> 00:16:15,599
The Chen family's shares?

333
00:16:15,679 --> 00:16:17,976
Chen Wan, do you still want
to pursue Zhao Shengge or not?

334
00:16:18,000 --> 00:16:19,000
I do.

335
00:16:19,639 --> 00:16:21,719
With a completely clean slate.

336
00:16:21,799 --> 00:16:22,936
Then you might as well give up.

337
00:16:22,960 --> 00:16:25,240
Pulling a stunt like this will
only make him destroy you.

338
00:16:26,799 --> 00:16:28,400
I'll explain everything to him.

339
00:16:28,480 --> 00:16:29,480
But you...

340
00:16:48,879 --> 00:16:50,599
Hey, are you out of your mind?

341
00:16:50,679 --> 00:16:52,280
Do you have any idea what you're doing?

342
00:16:52,360 --> 00:16:53,559
Do you think you're Superman?

343
00:16:53,639 --> 00:16:55,120
Taking everything on by yourself?

344
00:16:55,200 --> 00:16:57,040
Who even is Zhao Shengge to you?

345
00:16:57,120 --> 00:16:59,200
Does he have any clue how
much you're doing for him?

346
00:16:59,679 --> 00:17:00,360
Forget it.

347
00:17:00,440 --> 00:17:01,855
I know you won't listen
to a word I say anyway.

348
00:17:01,879 --> 00:17:02,879
Just think it through.

349
00:17:16,759 --> 00:17:17,759
Mr. Chen,

350
00:17:17,839 --> 00:17:19,320
are you still coming in today?

351
00:17:19,400 --> 00:17:20,559
I'm heading over now.

352
00:17:35,279 --> 00:17:36,799
I feel awful physically.

353
00:17:37,720 --> 00:17:38,839
I'm nauseous,

354
00:17:39,759 --> 00:17:40,759
and I have a headache.

355
00:17:43,759 --> 00:17:45,559
But I have to hold it together.

356
00:17:46,160 --> 00:17:47,519
I can't let anyone see.

357
00:17:49,000 --> 00:17:50,680
See what?

358
00:17:52,839 --> 00:17:54,079
The past.

359
00:17:55,000 --> 00:17:56,440
You're protecting yourself.

360
00:17:57,160 --> 00:17:58,359
Keeping him from finding out

361
00:17:58,880 --> 00:18:00,360
the things you think

362
00:18:00,440 --> 00:18:01,839
would make him leave you.

363
00:18:04,240 --> 00:18:05,279
But Mr. Chen,

364
00:18:05,880 --> 00:18:07,800
do you realize this habit of yours

365
00:18:07,880 --> 00:18:09,839
keeps him from seeing the real you?

366
00:18:11,960 --> 00:18:13,160
The real me?

367
00:18:14,440 --> 00:18:16,160
Your body is telling you,

368
00:18:16,240 --> 00:18:17,480
"I'm hurt.

369
00:18:18,200 --> 00:18:19,839
I need to be seen."

370
00:18:20,680 --> 00:18:21,680
Yet you're so used to

371
00:18:21,720 --> 00:18:24,719
hiding everything and saying nothing.

372
00:18:24,799 --> 00:18:25,936
You've suppressed that signal

373
00:18:25,960 --> 00:18:27,559
for far too long.

374
00:18:29,440 --> 00:18:30,440
I'm afraid

375
00:18:32,160 --> 00:18:34,039
that if I don't push it down,

376
00:18:34,119 --> 00:18:35,439
I'll...

377
00:18:35,519 --> 00:18:36,759
I'll fall apart.

378
00:18:39,039 --> 00:18:40,320
Mr. Chen,

379
00:18:40,400 --> 00:18:41,920
can you allow yourself

380
00:18:42,000 --> 00:18:43,400
to stop putting up a front

381
00:18:43,480 --> 00:18:45,000
when you're with him?

382
00:18:46,720 --> 00:18:49,039
That voice telling you to hold it together

383
00:18:49,119 --> 00:18:50,400
isn't the only voice inside you.

384
00:18:51,880 --> 00:18:53,039
The nausea,

385
00:18:53,119 --> 00:18:54,360
the pain—

386
00:18:54,440 --> 00:18:56,519
that's your body telling you,

387
00:18:57,599 --> 00:18:58,920
"I'm hurting."

388
00:19:01,000 --> 00:19:02,039
I'm afraid

389
00:19:03,480 --> 00:19:04,799
of losing him.

390
00:19:07,920 --> 00:19:08,920
It's okay.

391
00:19:09,759 --> 00:19:10,960
Give yourself some time.

392
00:19:17,400 --> 00:19:18,400
Thank you,

393
00:19:19,039 --> 00:19:20,039
Monica.

394
00:19:26,240 --> 00:19:28,119
Let's leave it at that. Go take care of it.

395
00:19:29,400 --> 00:19:30,400
By the way,

396
00:19:31,640 --> 00:19:32,640
some of Rongxin's recent

397
00:19:32,680 --> 00:19:34,640
minor share transactions

398
00:19:34,720 --> 00:19:35,720
look a bit suspicious.

399
00:19:37,400 --> 00:19:40,319
Why do you care about a sinking ship
like Rongxin?

400
00:19:40,839 --> 00:19:42,216
Even Chen Wan probably
wants nothing to do with it.

401
00:19:42,240 --> 00:19:43,735
His mother is still with the Chen family.

402
00:19:43,759 --> 00:19:44,679
I just don't want

403
00:19:44,759 --> 00:19:46,439
anything unpleasant to happen

404
00:19:46,519 --> 00:19:47,599
that might affect Chen Wan.

405
00:19:48,079 --> 00:19:49,840
Done watching from the sidelines?

406
00:19:49,920 --> 00:19:51,400
Ready to step into the ring yourself?

407
00:19:52,839 --> 00:19:54,600
I stay out of the Chen family's business.

408
00:19:54,680 --> 00:19:56,439
The Ge family from
Taiji and Xu Zhiying

409
00:19:56,519 --> 00:19:59,039
are always waiting to chip away
at Rongxin and swallow it whole.

410
00:19:59,680 --> 00:20:01,400
Chen Bingxin can fend for himself.

411
00:20:01,480 --> 00:20:02,480
I'm just worried.

412
00:20:03,039 --> 00:20:05,319
Chen Wan will waste his energy
worrying about his mother.

413
00:20:06,400 --> 00:20:08,120
Looking out for your mother-in-law already?

414
00:20:09,480 --> 00:20:10,775
He can't even focus on chasing me.

415
00:20:10,799 --> 00:20:12,279
At this rate, it'll take him forever.

416
00:20:12,880 --> 00:20:14,199
I'm giving him a heads-up

417
00:20:14,279 --> 00:20:16,079
just so he can be prepared.

418
00:20:17,000 --> 00:20:18,039
After all,

419
00:20:18,119 --> 00:20:19,640
Kexiang is Chen Wan's life's work.

420
00:20:20,200 --> 00:20:22,160
I don't want Rongxin's mess

421
00:20:22,240 --> 00:20:23,560
dragging Kexiang down.

422
00:20:23,640 --> 00:20:25,120
Save your breath.

423
00:20:25,200 --> 00:20:26,880
He's a silent partner at Kexiang.

424
00:20:27,920 --> 00:20:30,200
Even if there were changes,
they wouldn't be made public.

425
00:20:31,193 --> 00:20:31,933
Besides,

426
00:20:31,957 --> 00:20:33,335
[He's sending a pin to Tan Youming]

427
00:20:33,359 --> 00:20:35,279
doesn't he do whatever you say now?

428
00:20:35,359 --> 00:20:37,640
Finding out whatever you
want should be a breeze.

429
00:20:37,720 --> 00:20:38,960
You don't know him.

430
00:20:43,119 --> 00:20:44,519
Anyway, from the looks of it now,

431
00:20:46,160 --> 00:20:47,359
he has nothing to do with it.

432
00:20:48,960 --> 00:20:50,560
I just wish

433
00:20:50,640 --> 00:20:52,359
he could tell me everything.

434
00:20:52,960 --> 00:20:54,680
Nothing matters more than that.

435
00:21:00,559 --> 00:21:01,559
Mr. Shen.

436
00:21:03,279 --> 00:21:04,279
Mr. Zhao.

437
00:21:04,319 --> 00:21:08,080
As it stands, there's almost no overlap
between Ms. Song's assets and Mr. Chen's,

438
00:21:08,160 --> 00:21:11,680
except for some real estate and high-value
insurance policies where he's the beneficiary.

439
00:21:11,720 --> 00:21:13,279
Ms. Song's recent
shareholding ratio

440
00:21:13,359 --> 00:21:14,840
hasn't changed much.

441
00:21:14,920 --> 00:21:17,040
She likely had little to do
with this bottom-fishing.

442
00:21:17,559 --> 00:21:19,799
Then what about the false
boom in Rongxin's stock price?

443
00:21:21,880 --> 00:21:24,519
Tracking the cash flow
of her equity changes

444
00:21:24,599 --> 00:21:26,160
will take some more time.

445
00:21:26,240 --> 00:21:27,600
Rongxin's management is a mess,

446
00:21:27,680 --> 00:21:29,280
and their disclosures lack transparency.

447
00:21:30,599 --> 00:21:31,599
Keep digging.

448
00:21:32,359 --> 00:21:33,359
Okay.

449
00:21:48,559 --> 00:21:50,560
I thought it was Qiansheng.

450
00:21:50,640 --> 00:21:52,840
Turns out it's the top enforcer.

451
00:21:52,920 --> 00:21:54,640
The boss trusted you so much, and for what?

452
00:21:54,680 --> 00:21:56,160
Playing dirty behind his back,

453
00:21:56,240 --> 00:21:58,600
and you still have the nerve
to show up at White Crane Hall?

454
00:22:01,519 --> 00:22:03,039
White Crane Hall

455
00:22:03,119 --> 00:22:05,240
isn't yours to command.

456
00:22:07,640 --> 00:22:08,840
If I don't call the shots,

457
00:22:08,920 --> 00:22:10,360
then who does?

458
00:22:10,440 --> 00:22:14,960
That two-faced
fence-sitter Shao Yaozong?

459
00:22:17,032 --> 00:22:18,752
For the sake of our brotherhood,

460
00:22:18,839 --> 00:22:20,640
let me give you one
piece of friendly advice.

461
00:22:20,720 --> 00:22:23,160
Look at how Luo Qiansheng ended up.

462
00:22:23,240 --> 00:22:25,079
Watch your step.

463
00:22:26,720 --> 00:22:28,039
Boss Li,

464
00:22:28,119 --> 00:22:31,039
Luo Qiansheng wasn't smart.

465
00:22:31,119 --> 00:22:32,360
And I won't be giving

466
00:22:32,440 --> 00:22:33,920
that nephew of mine another chance.

467
00:22:38,359 --> 00:22:39,359
As for you,

468
00:22:39,400 --> 00:22:40,880
it's time for you to leave, too.

469
00:22:42,119 --> 00:22:44,400
Always yapping away.

470
00:22:44,480 --> 00:22:45,640
What an eyesore.

471
00:23:03,039 --> 00:23:04,560
Well, look who's here.

472
00:23:04,640 --> 00:23:05,640
Jiaming.

473
00:23:05,680 --> 00:23:07,519
Heard you found yourself a powerful backer.

474
00:23:07,599 --> 00:23:08,920
Congratulations.

475
00:23:11,279 --> 00:23:12,616
If you have any ways to make a fortune,

476
00:23:12,640 --> 00:23:13,959
remember to help me out.

477
00:23:14,039 --> 00:23:15,560
Right back at you.

478
00:23:15,640 --> 00:23:17,719
The Consigliere has
always been well-connected.

479
00:23:17,799 --> 00:23:19,479
I wouldn't dare say I'm helping you out.

480
00:23:19,559 --> 00:23:20,439
Why is everyone

481
00:23:20,519 --> 00:23:21,640
here today?

482
00:23:21,720 --> 00:23:23,680
It's almost a hundred
days since the boss passed.

483
00:23:24,039 --> 00:23:25,480
So you still remember the boss?

484
00:23:26,799 --> 00:23:28,320
That's rich coming from you.

485
00:23:28,400 --> 00:23:31,079
You went your own way
before his body was even cold.

486
00:23:31,599 --> 00:23:33,160
Since you're so capable,

487
00:23:33,240 --> 00:23:34,959
why are you coming after me?

488
00:23:35,039 --> 00:23:37,039
To each his own path.

489
00:23:37,119 --> 00:23:38,239
Don't tell me you don't know

490
00:23:38,319 --> 00:23:39,640
about the boss's death.

491
00:23:40,359 --> 00:23:41,279
If you don't get out,

492
00:23:41,359 --> 00:23:43,359
you'll end up just like him.

493
00:23:46,640 --> 00:23:48,079
Watch yourself.

494
00:23:54,719 --> 00:23:55,271
[Haishi Municipal Superivison
Bureau's noticce regarding the handling

495
00:23:55,295 --> 00:23:55,846
of Chen Wan's suspected market
manipulation in Rongxin equity trading]

496
00:23:55,880 --> 00:23:56,959
Mr. Chen Wan,

497
00:23:57,039 --> 00:23:58,039
our investigation shows

498
00:23:58,119 --> 00:23:59,575
that during the Rongxin equity trading,

499
00:23:59,599 --> 00:24:01,136
you engaged in stock market manipulation.

500
00:24:01,160 --> 00:24:02,439
Please come with us

501
00:24:02,519 --> 00:24:03,640
for further questioning.

502
00:24:05,759 --> 00:24:06,759
Okay.

503
00:24:07,359 --> 00:24:08,359
Officers,

504
00:24:09,920 --> 00:24:11,160
I'd like to have a few minutes

505
00:24:11,240 --> 00:24:12,240
with Mr. Chen.

506
00:24:13,160 --> 00:24:14,160
Sure.

507
00:24:21,119 --> 00:24:22,640
Do you have anything to say to me?

508
00:24:25,200 --> 00:24:26,720
You've already seen it all.

509
00:24:27,240 --> 00:24:28,240
Chen Wan.

510
00:24:29,640 --> 00:24:31,400
I asked if you have anything to say to me.

511
00:24:35,359 --> 00:24:37,279
This is my own business.

512
00:24:37,359 --> 00:24:38,680
I'll take the fall myself.

513
00:24:40,039 --> 00:24:41,480
Your own business?

514
00:24:44,160 --> 00:24:45,160
Chen Wan,

515
00:24:46,680 --> 00:24:47,960
what do you take me for?

516
00:24:48,920 --> 00:24:50,119
A casual hookup,

517
00:24:51,039 --> 00:24:52,279
or just a client?

518
00:24:54,440 --> 00:24:55,440
Zhao Shengge,

519
00:24:56,359 --> 00:24:57,279
please don't do this.

520
00:24:57,359 --> 00:24:59,759
Do you think I'd give up on you over this?

521
00:25:05,319 --> 00:25:07,920
Do you think my feelings
for you are that cheap?

522
00:25:12,920 --> 00:25:13,920
Chen Wan,

523
00:25:15,400 --> 00:25:17,000
I'm so disappointed in you.

524
00:25:41,839 --> 00:25:43,200
What do you take me for?

525
00:25:44,119 --> 00:25:45,400
A casual hookup,

526
00:25:46,319 --> 00:25:47,359
or just a client?

527
00:25:52,440 --> 00:25:54,799
Do you really think so
little of my feelings for you?

528
00:26:00,640 --> 00:26:03,200
Do you think my feelings
for you are that cheap?

529
00:26:08,160 --> 00:26:09,160
Chen Wan,

530
00:26:10,480 --> 00:26:11,960
I'm so disappointed in you.

531
00:26:32,960 --> 00:26:33,759
Hold his hands!

532
00:26:33,839 --> 00:26:34,880
Don't let him move!

533
00:26:36,559 --> 00:26:37,560
Hold his hands!

534
00:26:37,640 --> 00:26:38,640
Don't let him move!

535
00:26:40,359 --> 00:26:42,559
You'll never get out of
here for the rest of your life!

536
00:26:44,880 --> 00:26:53,765
You'll never get out of
here for the rest of your life!

537
00:27:10,079 --> 00:27:11,079
Shengge,

538
00:27:11,720 --> 00:27:13,559
why did you call me over in such a hurry?

539
00:27:15,160 --> 00:27:16,160
Xuan,

540
00:27:18,000 --> 00:27:19,160
I know everything.

541
00:27:21,386 --> 00:27:23,046
[Xiaolanshan Psychiatric Institution]

542
00:27:23,920 --> 00:27:26,400
But I want to hear it from you again.

543
00:27:30,160 --> 00:27:31,160
Of course,

544
00:27:31,799 --> 00:27:33,759
this isn't an order or a threat.

545
00:27:35,640 --> 00:27:37,200
It's a personal request.

546
00:27:42,519 --> 00:27:43,519
Have a seat.

547
00:27:57,400 --> 00:27:59,880
I don't know that much about Xiaolanshan.

548
00:28:01,319 --> 00:28:02,599
He did tell me, though,

549
00:28:04,880 --> 00:28:07,200
that since the first time he saw you there,

550
00:28:08,079 --> 00:28:09,320
up until now,

551
00:28:09,400 --> 00:28:10,759
it's been sixteen years.

552
00:28:17,799 --> 00:28:18,920
Do you remember

553
00:28:19,640 --> 00:28:21,680
when you flew to California
early after graduation,

554
00:28:22,440 --> 00:28:24,600
and Tan Youming got a
group of friends to see you off?

555
00:28:25,240 --> 00:28:26,160
Right before you went through security,

556
00:28:26,240 --> 00:28:27,840
I asked if you could

557
00:28:27,920 --> 00:28:29,240
wait just one more minute?

558
00:28:30,720 --> 00:28:31,720
I don't remember.

559
00:28:33,279 --> 00:28:35,039
Chen Wan was rushing over.

560
00:28:35,920 --> 00:28:36,479
He...

561
00:28:36,559 --> 00:28:37,799
He had escaped.

562
00:28:39,559 --> 00:28:41,840
Chen Bingxin had locked
him in the basement,

563
00:28:41,920 --> 00:28:42,840
because...

564
00:28:42,920 --> 00:28:45,959
Song Qingmiao had gambled heavily.

565
00:28:46,039 --> 00:28:47,440
Chen Bingxin was furious

566
00:28:48,000 --> 00:28:49,839
and beat the two of them severely.

567
00:28:52,640 --> 00:28:54,759
Chen Wan also got into your university.

568
00:28:56,799 --> 00:28:58,599
When he found out
you were flying out early,

569
00:28:59,759 --> 00:29:01,599
he said he wanted to see you one more time.

570
00:29:02,960 --> 00:29:03,960
Of course,

571
00:29:04,519 --> 00:29:08,160
he just looked at you
from afar by the jet bridge.

572
00:29:10,000 --> 00:29:11,640
He wouldn't come over to bother you.

573
00:29:13,880 --> 00:29:15,400
And do you remember

574
00:29:15,480 --> 00:29:16,559
that one semester

575
00:29:17,920 --> 00:29:19,759
when we signed up for football class?

576
00:29:19,839 --> 00:29:21,719
The extra wristbands I
always claimed I brought

577
00:29:21,799 --> 00:29:22,719
were actually

578
00:29:22,799 --> 00:29:24,320
prepared by Wan.

579
00:29:24,400 --> 00:29:25,599
A lot of the drinks, too.

580
00:29:27,519 --> 00:29:27,880
You...

581
00:29:27,960 --> 00:29:29,560
You definitely don't remember any of it.

582
00:29:31,880 --> 00:29:32,880
Chen Wan,

583
00:29:32,960 --> 00:29:35,335
he watched every single one of
your speeches and competitions.

584
00:29:35,359 --> 00:29:36,359
Later on,

585
00:29:37,000 --> 00:29:39,119
when I went on an exchange program,

586
00:29:40,119 --> 00:29:41,599
he couldn't go watch anymore.

587
00:29:42,480 --> 00:29:43,519
Also,

588
00:29:43,599 --> 00:29:45,199
that award-winning model of yours

589
00:29:45,279 --> 00:29:47,080
on display in the Shaw Building.

590
00:29:47,160 --> 00:29:48,880
There were so many typhoons that semester,

591
00:29:50,000 --> 00:29:51,680
and after every typhoon day,

592
00:29:52,559 --> 00:29:54,519
he'd take my card,

593
00:29:54,599 --> 00:29:56,120
sneak inside,

594
00:29:56,200 --> 00:29:58,240
and wipe your model clean, bit by bit.

595
00:29:59,759 --> 00:30:01,039
That robot...?

596
00:30:06,440 --> 00:30:08,359
So none of it was a coincidence.

597
00:30:10,720 --> 00:30:11,720
What's the time?

598
00:30:13,480 --> 00:30:14,719
One minute and five seconds.

599
00:30:14,799 --> 00:30:16,039
One minute and five seconds!

600
00:30:16,119 --> 00:30:18,039
That's a new record!

601
00:30:19,559 --> 00:30:21,000
I can't hold him back.

602
00:30:21,920 --> 00:30:23,440
He doesn't care about anyone.

603
00:30:25,279 --> 00:30:26,279
Zhao Shengge,

604
00:30:28,359 --> 00:30:30,200
you're the only tether
keeping him grounded,

605
00:30:32,039 --> 00:30:33,640
and his last shred of sanity.

606
00:30:34,599 --> 00:30:36,759
He's suffered so much to get this far.

607
00:30:39,000 --> 00:30:40,599
He used to tell me all the time

608
00:30:41,960 --> 00:30:43,680
that he wanted to buy a boat

609
00:30:45,839 --> 00:30:47,720
so he could leave Haishi,

610
00:30:49,720 --> 00:30:51,200
and leave that home behind.

611
00:30:55,440 --> 00:30:57,799
For him to finally stand in front of you,

612
00:30:59,759 --> 00:31:01,519
it really wasn't easy for Chen Wan.

613
00:31:13,799 --> 00:31:14,799
Han Jin,

614
00:31:16,000 --> 00:31:17,160
this is Zhao Shengge.

615
00:31:19,000 --> 00:31:20,799
Halt the equity transfer.

616
00:31:27,920 --> 00:31:29,120
Lucas,

617
00:31:29,200 --> 00:31:31,560
handle the CSRC license penalty.

618
00:31:31,640 --> 00:31:32,759
Draft a response plan

619
00:31:33,440 --> 00:31:34,640
and stall them for a day.

620
00:31:34,720 --> 00:31:36,600
Look into Song Qingmiao's recent accounts.

621
00:31:36,680 --> 00:31:37,680
Also,

622
00:31:37,759 --> 00:31:39,759
let Fang Jian make his
own call over his issue.

623
00:31:40,400 --> 00:31:41,400
I don't have time today.

624
00:31:45,960 --> 00:31:46,960
Xuan.

625
00:31:48,640 --> 00:31:49,640
Thank you.

626
00:31:50,599 --> 00:31:51,759
I'm heading out for a bit.

627
00:31:51,839 --> 00:31:52,839
Make yourself at home.

628
00:31:59,559 --> 00:32:00,799
Chen Wan's suffering

629
00:32:01,640 --> 00:32:02,720
is finally over.
